WEBVTT

00:00:00.778 --> 00:00:01.418
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.438 --> 00:00:04.746
<v><b>F:</b></v> Life is faster than before.

00:00:06.795 --> 00:00:07.461
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:08.511 --> 00:00:11.248
<v><b>M:</b></v> Traffic in cities is worse than it was.

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:14.065
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:15.043 --> 00:00:18.371
<v><b>F:</b></v> Everybody is busier than they were five years ago.

00:00:20.399 --> 00:00:21.122
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:25.311
<v><b>M:</b></v> We are more stressed than our grandparents were.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:28.211
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:29.284 --> 00:00:31.188
<v><b>F:</b></v> We do everything more quickly.

00:00:33.163 --> 00:00:33.955
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:35.065 --> 00:00:37.815
<v><b>M:</b></v> People aren’t as patient as they were before.